t forever\n2: eth0@if106: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 1500 qdisc noqueue state UP group default \n    link/ether 5e:64:16:2c:81:e7 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff link-netnsid 0\n    inet 172.20.20.19/24 brd 172.20.20.255 scope global eth0\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 3fff:172:20:20::13/64 scope global nodad \n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 fe80::5c64:16ff:fe2c:81e7/64 scope link proto kernel_ll \n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n110: eth1@if109: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 9500 qdisc noqueue state UP group default \n    link/ether aa:c1:ab:87:51:c5 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff link-netnsid 1\n    inet 10.0.0.64/24 scope global eth1\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 fe80::a8c1:abff:fe87:51c5/64 scope link proto kernel_ll \n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_04fcd559f2cb41a6a12647b0'}, {'content': "Good! I can see that eth1 already has the correct IP address configured (10.0.0.64/24) and it's UP. Now let me check the routing table:", 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_e257c964d817481ba3a19a97', 'function': {'name': 'node_config_tool', 'arguments': '{"container_name": "clab-simple-pentest-lab-20260108-023817-87fca001-attacker", "command": "ip route show"}'}}]}, {'content': 'Output:\ndefault via 10.0.0.1 dev eth1 \n10.0.0.0/24 dev eth1 proto kernel scope link src 10.0.0.64 \n172.20.20.0/24 dev eth0 proto kernel scope link src 172.20.20.19 \n', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_e257c964d817481ba3a19a97'}, {'content': 'Excellent! The default route is already configured correctly (via 10.0.0.1 dev eth1). Now let me check if the necessary tools are available:', 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_de210bab53064993982f3d1d', 'function': {'name': 'node_config_tool', 'arguments': '{"container_name": "clab-simple-pentest-lab-20260108-023817-87fca001-attacke